<g fill="#dda154"><path d="M473 83l3 10 10 3-10 3-3 10-3-10-10-3 10-3z"/><path d="M114 212l2 7 7 2-7 2-2 7-2-7-7-2 7-2z"/></g></svg><div class="journey-visual-bottom"><span class="journey-state">Getting comfortable</span><span>01 / 05</span></div></div><div class="journey-switches" role="group" aria-label="Explore the five phases"><button type="button" data-phase-select="0" aria-label="Phase 1: A little unsure." aria-pressed="true">01</button><button type="button" data-phase-select="1" aria-label="Phase 2: One paw at a time." aria-pressed="false">02</button><button type="button" data-phase-select="2" aria-label="Phase 3: Finding their rhythm." aria-pressed="false">03</button><button type="button" data-phase-select="3" aria-label="Phase 4: Let’s try a little more." aria-pressed="false">04</button><button type="button" data-phase-select="4" aria-label="Phase 5: Free reign. Full joy." aria-pressed="false">05</button></div><div class="journey-chart"><div><p class="eyebrow">LITTLE WINS ADD UP</p><span>Illustrative progress</span></div><svg viewBox="0 0 460 110" role="img" aria-label="Example confidence trend rising over five milestones; illustrative, not measured dog data"><path d="M20 20H440M20 55H440M20 90H440" stroke="#e0dacd" stroke-dasharray="3 5"/><path d="M25 90Q78 91 125 73T230 57T335 32T435 12" fill="none" stroke="#327342" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle data-chart-point="0" cx="25" cy="90" r="6" fill="#fff9ee" stroke="#327342" stroke-width="3"/><circle data-chart-point="1" cx="125" cy="73" r="6" fill="#fff9ee" stroke="#327342" stroke-width="3"/><circle data-chart-point="2" cx="230" cy="57" r="6" fill="#fff9ee" stroke="#327342" stroke-width="3"/><circle data-chart-point="3" cx="335" cy="32" r="6" fill="#fff9ee" stroke="#327342" stroke-width="3"/><circle data-chart-point="4" cx="435" cy="12" r="6" fill="#fff9ee" stroke="#327342" stroke-width="3"/></svg><div class="chart-labels"><span>First introduction</span><span>Growing confidence</span></div><p class="chart-note">An example journey, not a measured result. Real progress may include pauses, repeat phases, and smaller wins.</p></div></div><div class="journey-stages"><article class="journey-stage is-active" data-stage="0"><span class="stage-number">PHASE 01</span><h3>A little unsure.</h3><p class="stage-subtitle">The first brave moment.</p><p>New space. New sounds. Paws planted firmly on the belt. Some pups hesitate before taking a step. We give them time to get comfortable.</p><div class="stage-benefit"><span>✳</span> A calm introduction</div></article><article class="journey-stage" data-stage="1"><span class="stage-number">PHASE 02</span><h3>One paw at a time.</h3><p class="stage-subtitle">Small steps. Big courage.</p><p>A little confidence arrives. They begin stepping forward, concentrating on where each paw lands. Every little step is a win.</p><div class="stage-benefit"><span>✳</span> Focus & coordination</div></article><article class="journey-stage" data-stage="2"><span class="stage-number">PHASE 03</span><h3>Finding their rhythm.</h3><p class="stage-subtitle">Look who’s got this.</p><p>Those careful steps become a steady pattern. Your dog finds a comfortable rhythm and keeps the belt moving under their own power.</p><div class="stage-benefit"><span>✳</span> A consistent rhythm</div></article><article class="journey-stage" data-stage="3"><span class="stage-number">PHASE 04</span><h3>Let’s try a little more.</h3><p class="stage-subtitle">Their pace. Their choice.</p><p>Speed up. Slow down. Stop. Start again. With a rhythm established, they explore how their movement changes the belt’s speed.</p><div class="stage-benefit"><span>✳</span> Choice & confidence</div></article><article class="journey-stage" data-stage="4"><span class="stage-number">PHASE 05</span><h3>Free reign. Full joy.</h3><p class="stage-subtitle">That’s one happy runner.</p><p>They know the ropes and move with confidence, exploring what they can do. Their coach stays close, with breaks and a pace that suits the dog.</p><div class="stage-benefit"><span>✳</span> Movement & enrichment</div></article></div></div><div class="journey-real">{% render 't4t-image', image: section.settings.image, fallback: 'running-dog.jpg', width: 1000, height: 750, loading: 'lazy', sizes: '(min-width: 601px) 45vw, 100vw', alt: 'A real Tracks 4 Treats dog on the dog-powered treadmill' %}<div><p class="eyebrow">REAL DOGS. THEIR OWN PACE.</p><h3>The best progress?<br>A pup who wants to try.</h3><p>A coach by their side. A comfortable space. And the freedom to walk, run, slow down, or take a break.</p><a class="button" href="{% if settings.booking_page != blank %}{{ settings.booking_page.url }}{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}pages/booking{% endif %}">Start their first chapter</a></div></div></t4t-journey>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Dog confidence journey",
  "limit": 1,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "From first steps.\nTo full tail wags."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "intro",
      "label": "Introduction",
      "default": "Confidence is a journey. Come along for the run."
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image",
      "label": "Real session photo"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Dog confidence journey"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}